### Create a user
POST {{baseUrl}}/users
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: bearer {{token}}

{
  "name": "johndoe",
  "email": "john@example.com",
  "password": "secret123",
  "activated": true
}

### Login (returns an access token)
POST {{baseUrl}}/users/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "alex",
  "password": "alexi"
}

### Get a user by id
GET {{baseUrl}}/users/1
Authorization: bearer {{token}}

### List users
GET {{baseUrl}}/users?page_size=10&page_id=0
Authorization: bearer {{token}}

### Update a user
PUT {{baseUrl}}/users
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: bearer {{token}}

{
  "id": 1,
  "name": "alex",
  "email": "alex@example.com",
  "password": "alexi",
  "activate": true
}

### Delete a user
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/users/1
Authorization: bearer {{token}}
